<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru" class="js">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Opportunity Bridge — scholarships, internships, exchange programs & competitions for students</title>
<meta name="description" content="Opportunity Bridge is a student-run project (founder Sabina Umarova) with a free Telegram bot matching students to scholarships, internships, exchange programs, summer schools, competitions, research and volunteer opportunities. Team: Sabina Umarova (Founder), Anna Kuznetsova (Research & Database), Daria Bashkova (Community), Snizhana Vasiuk (Content), Arina Kazarian (Marketing).">
<meta property="og:title" content="Opportunity Bridge — student opportunities, curated">
<meta property="og:description" content="Scholarships, internships, exchange programs, competitions and webinars for students — run by a student team via a free Telegram bot.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz@0,9..144;1,9..144&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: #FAFBF6; --bg-alt: #EEF3E6; --card: #FFFFFF;
    --line: #DCE6D4; --green-deep: #3E6249; --green: #6B9A72;
    --green-soft: #A9C9A6; --gold: #D8A657; --text: #202A21; --muted: #5E6E5F;
    --serif: 'Fraunces', serif; --sans: 'Work Sans', sans-serif; --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }
  *{ box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
  html{ scroll-behavior:smooth; }
  body{ background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: var(--sans); line-height:1.55; overflow-x:hidden; }
  a{ color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
  ::selection{ background: var(--green-soft); color: var(--green-deep); }
  .wrap{ max-width: 1120px; margin:0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--green-deep); outline-offset:3px; }

  [hidden]{ display:none !important; }

  .js [data-reveal]{ opacity:0; transform: translateY(18px); transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease; }
  .js [data-reveal].revealed{ opacity:1; transform:none; }

  header{ position: sticky; top:0; z-index:50; background: rgba(250,251,246,0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  nav{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:16px 0; gap: 16px; }
  .brand{ font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 20px; color: var(--green-deep); white-space:nowrap; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
  .brand-mark{ width:26px; height:26px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .brand b{ font-style: normal; font-weight: 600; }
  .nav-links{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap: 26px; }
  .nav-links a.nav-item{ font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); transition: color .2s ease; }
  .nav-links a.nav-item:hover{ color: var(--green-deep); }
  .lang-toggle{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: .04em; display:flex; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; overflow:hidden; }
  .lang-toggle button{ background:none; border:none; padding: 6px 11px; cursor:pointer; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .lang-toggle button.active{ background: var(--green-deep); color:#fff; }
  .nav-cta{ font-size: 13px; font-weight:600; color:#fff !important; background: var(--green-deep); padding: 9px 16px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .nav-cta:hover{ background: var(--green); }
  .nav-toggle{ display:none; }
  @media (max-width: 900px){
    .nav-links{ position: fixed; inset: 60px 0 auto 0; background: var(--bg-alt); flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 20px 28px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); transform: translateY(-140%); transition: transform .3s ease; }
    .nav-links.open{ transform: translateY(0); }
    .nav-toggle{ display:block; background:none; border:none; font-size:22px; color:var(--green-deep); cursor:pointer; }
  }

  .hero{ position: relative; padding: 76px 0 100px; overflow:visible; }
  .hero-blob{ position:absolute; top:-180px; right:-200px; width:560px; height:560px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, var(--green-soft), transparent 70%); opacity: .5; z-index:0; }
  .hero-blob2{ position:absolute; bottom:-120px; left:-160px; width:360px; height:360px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 60% 40%, var(--gold), transparent 72%); opacity: .18; z-index:0; }
  .hero-grid{ position:relative; z-index:1; display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; gap: 40px; align-items:center; }
  .eyebrow{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--green-deep); letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .eyebrow::before{ content:''; width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background: var(--gold); }
  h1{ font-family: var(--serif); font-weight:400; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(34px, 5.6vw, 60px); line-height: 1.08; color: var(--green-deep); }
  .hero-sub{ margin-top: 20px; font-size: 17px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 50ch; }
  .hero-actions{ margin-top: 32px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap: 13px; }
  .btn{ font-weight: 600; font-size: 14.5px; padding: 13px 22px; border-radius: 999px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap: 8px; transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease; border: 1px solid transparent; }
  .btn-solid{ background: var(--green-deep); color:#fff; }
  .btn-solid:hover{ transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 26px -10px rgba(62,98,73,0.45); }
  .btn-outline{ border-color: var(--line); background: var(--card); color: var(--text); }
  .btn-outline:hover{ border-color: var(--green-deep); color: var(--green-deep); }
  .btn-gold{ background: var(--gold); color: #2C210C; }
  .btn-gold:hover{ transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 26px -10px rgba(216,166,87,0.5); }
  .btn-sm{ padding: 9px 16px; font-size: 13px; }

  .collage{ position:relative; height: 380px; }
  .polaroid{ position:absolute; background:#fff; padding: 7px 7px 30px; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 18px 36px -12px rgba(32,42,33,0.28); width: 150px; }
  .polaroid img{ width:100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 2px; display:block; }
  .polaroid figcaption{ position:absolute; bottom:8px; left:10px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing:.02em; }
  .p1{ top: 0; left: 24px; transform: rotate(-7deg); z-index: 3; }
  .p2{ top: 40px; left: 190px; transform: rotate(5deg); z-index: 2; width: 132px; }
  .p3{ top: 210px; left: 40px; transform: rotate(4deg); z-index: 1; width: 132px; }
  .p4{ top: 190px; left: 200px; transform: rotate(-4deg); z-index: 2; width: 140px; }
  @media (max-width: 940px){ .hero-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .collage{ height: 300px; margin-top: 12px; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px){ .collage{ display:none; } }

  .wave{ display:block; width:100%; height:48px; margin-top:-1px; }

  section{ padding: 76px 0; }
  .section-eyebrow{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--green); letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
  .section-eyebrow::before{ content:'❧'; color: var(--gold); font-size: 13px; }
  h2{ font-family: var(--serif); font-weight:400; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(27px, 3.8vw, 38px); color: var(--green-deep); line-height:1.15; }
  .section-sub{ margin-top: 14px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15.5px; max-width: 58ch; }

  #about{ background: var(--bg-alt); border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .about-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 56px; align-items:start; }
  .about-text p{ color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .leaf-list{ list-style:none; margin-top: 22px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap: 12px; background: var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px 24px; }
  .leaf-list li{ display:flex; gap: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text); align-items:flex-start; }
  .leaf-list li::before{ content:'❧'; color: var(--green); font-size: 15px; line-height:1.3; flex-shrink:0; }
  @media (max-width: 820px){ .about-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; } }

  .team-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; margin-top: 40px; }
  .member{ background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; transition: border-color .2s ease, transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease; }
  .member:hover{ border-color: var(--green-soft); transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 20px 36px -20px rgba(62,98,73,0.35); }
  .avatar{ width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4; border-radius: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-soft), var(--green)); margin-bottom: 15px; background-size: cover; background-position: center 18%; }
  .member-name{ font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 19px; font-style: italic; color: var(--green-deep); }
  .member-flag{ font-style: normal; font-size: 15px; margin-left: 4px; }
  .member-role{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing:.03em; margin-top:7px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .member details{ margin-top: 14px; }
  .member summary{ cursor:pointer; list-style:none; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--green); letter-spacing:.03em; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; }
  .member summary::-webkit-details-marker{ display:none; }
  .member summary::after{ content:'⌄'; transition: transform .2s ease; }
  .member details[open] summary::after{ transform: rotate(180deg); }
  .member summary:hover{ color: var(--green-deep); }
  .member-details-inner{ border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 13px; margin-top:12px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap: 10px; }
  .m-field-label{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--muted); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em; }
  .m-field-value{ font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); margin-top: 3px; line-height:1.5; }
  .m-field-value ul{ list-style:none; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap: 4px; }
  .m-field-value li::before{ content:'— '; color: var(--green); }
  @media (max-width: 860px){ .team-grid{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px){ .team-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  #competitions, #webinars{ background: var(--bg-alt); border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .comp-list, .web-list{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap: 16px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .comp-card{ background: var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-left: 4px solid var(--gold); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 26px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease; }
  .comp-card:hover{ transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 20px 36px -22px rgba(62,98,73,0.3); }
  .comp-left{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap: 6px; }
  .comp-name{ font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 21px; color: var(--green-deep); }
  .comp-desc{ font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 52ch; }
  .comp-right{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap: 16px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .comp-deadline{ text-align:right; }
  .comp-deadline-label{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em; }
  .comp-deadline-date{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--text); margin-top: 3px; }
  .badge{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; padding: 5px 11px; border-radius: 999px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em; white-space:nowrap; }
  .badge-open, .badge-active{ background: #E4F0E1; color: var(--green-deep); }
  .badge-soon{ background: #FBEFD8; color: #8A5E1B; }
  .comp-actions{ flex-shrink:0; width:100%; margin-top: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px){ .comp-card{ flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; } .comp-right{ width:100%; justify-content: space-between; } .comp-actions .btn{ width:100%; justify-content:center; } }

  .web-card{ background: var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-left: 4px solid var(--green); border-radius: 16px; padding: 26px 28px; }
  .web-top{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .web-title{ font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 23px; color: var(--green-deep); max-width: 44ch; }
  .web-org{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; letter-spacing:.02em; }
  .web-org b{ color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
  .web-meta{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap: 14px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .web-dates{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); text-align:right; }
  .web-desc{ font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 16px; max-width: 68ch; }
  .speaker-list{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap: 11px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .speaker{ background: var(--bg-alt); border-radius: 12px; padding: 13px 16px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap: 3px; }
  .speaker-name{ font-weight: 600; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text); }
  .speaker-school{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  .speaker-topic{ font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; font-style: italic; }
  .web-actions{ margin-top: 18px; }

  .cta-band{ background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-deep), #2E4B37); border-radius: 24px; padding: 56px 40px; text-align:center; color: #fff; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .cta-band::before{ content:''; position:absolute; top:-80px; right:-80px; width:260px; height:260px; border-radius:50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(216,166,87,0.25), transparent 70%); }
  .cta-band h2{ color: #fff; position:relative; }
  .cta-band .section-sub{ color: #D8E6D2; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; position:relative; }
  .cta-band .hero-actions{ justify-content:center; margin-top: 28px; position:relative; }
  .cta-band .btn-outline{ background: transparent; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color:#fff; }
  .cta-band .btn-outline:hover{ border-color:#fff; }

  footer{ border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding: 34px 0; }
  .footer-row{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:14px; }
  .footer-links{ display:flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .footer-links a{ color: var(--muted); font-size:13px; }
  .footer-links a:hover{ color: var(--green-deep); }
  .footer-note{ font-family: var(--mono); font-size:12px; color: var(--muted); }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ html{ scroll-behavior:auto; } .js [data-reveal]{ opacity:1; transform:none; transition:none; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <a class="brand" href="#top">
        <svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><path d="M4 22c4-8 8-8 12 0s8 8 12 0" stroke="#3E6249" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="4" cy="22" r="2" fill="#D8A657"/><circle cx="28" cy="22" r="2" fill="#D8A657"/></svg>
        Opportunity <b>Bridge</b>
      </a>
      <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>
      <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <a class="nav-item" href="#about"><span class="ru">О проекте</span><span class="en" hidden>About</span></a>
        <a class="nav-item" href="#team"><span class="ru">Наша команда</span><span class="en" hidden>Our Team</span></a>
        <a class="nav-item" href="#competitions"><span class="ru">Наши конкурсы</span><span class="en" hidden>Our Competitions</span></a>
        <a class="nav-item" href="#webinars"><span class="ru">Вебинары</span><span class="en" hidden>Webinars</span></a>
        <div class="lang-toggle">
          <button id="langRu">RU</button>
          <button id="langEn">EN</button>
        </div>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="https://t.me/oppbridge_bot" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ru">Открыть бота</span><span class="en" hidden>Open the Bot</span></a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-blob" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-blob2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="ru">Возможности для студентов</span><span class="en" hidden>Student opportunities, curated</span></div>
        <h1>
          <span class="ru">Место, где студенты находят свою следующую возможность.</span>
          <span class="en" hidden>Where students find their next opportunity.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
          <span class="ru">Стипендии, стажировки, программы обмена, конкурсы и вебинары — подобрано под твой уровень, страну и направление. Ведём бота, канал и живое сообщество.</span>
          <span class="en" hidden>Scholarships, internships, exchange programs, competitions and webinars — matched to your level, country, and field. We run the bot, the channel, and a live community.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-solid" href="https://t.me/oppbridge_bot" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ru">Открыть бота</span><span class="en" hidden>Open the Bot</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://t.me/oppbridge" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ru">Наш канал</span><span class="en" hidden>Join our Channel</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://t.me/oppbridge_01" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ru">Наше сообщество</span><span class="en" hidden>Join our Community</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="collage" aria-hidden="true">
        <figure class="polaroid p1"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt=""><figcaption>Sabina</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="polaroid p2"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt=""><figcaption>Anna</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="polaroid p3"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt=""><figcaption>Daria</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="polaroid p4"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt=""><figcaption>Arina</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <svg class="wave" viewBox="0 0 1200 48" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M0,24 C300,48 300,0 600,24 C900,48 900,0 1200,24 L1200,48 L0,48 Z" fill="#EEF3E6"/>
  </svg>

  <section id="about">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="about-grid" data-reveal>
        <div class="about-text">
          <div class="section-eyebrow"><span class="ru">О нас</span><span class="en" hidden>About us</span></div>
          <h2 style="margin-bottom:18px;"><span class="ru">Создано студентами для студентов.</span><span class="en" hidden>Built by students, for students.</span></h2>
          <p>
            <span class="ru">Opportunity Bridge начался с простой идеи: поиск стипендии или стажировки не должен превращаться в бесконечный скроллинг списков, которые тебе не подходят.</span>
            <span class="en" hidden>Opportunity Bridge started as a simple idea: finding a scholarship or internship shouldn't mean scrolling through hundreds of listings that don't apply to you.</span>
          </p>
          <p>
            <span class="ru">Мы сделали Telegram-бота, который фильтрует возможности по уровню, стране и направлению — а каждую запись мы проверяем сами перед публикацией.</span>
            <span class="en" hidden>We built a Telegram bot that filters opportunities by your level, country, and field — and we curate every listing ourselves before it goes live.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="leaf-list">
          <li><span class="ru">Стипендии, стажировки, программы обмена, летние школы, конкурсы, исследования и волонтёрские программы</span><span class="en" hidden>Scholarships, internships, exchange programs, summer schools, competitions, research and volunteer programs</span></li>
          <li><span class="ru">Каждая запись проверяется и обновляется нашей командой</span><span class="en" hidden>Every listing checked and updated by our team</span></li>
          <li><span class="ru">Бесплатный Telegram-бот, канал с гайдами и чат сообщества</span><span class="en" hidden>A free Telegram bot, a guides channel, and a community chat</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="team">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="section-eyebrow"><span class="ru">Наша команда</span><span class="en" hidden>Our team</span></div>
        <h2><span class="ru">Люди, которые стоят за проектом.</span><span class="en" hidden>The people behind the bridge.</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="team-grid">
        <div class="member" data-reveal>
          <div class="avatar" style="background-image:url('data:image/jpeg;base64,')"></div>
          <div class="member-name">Umarova Sabina<span class="member-flag">🇺🇿</span></div>
          <div class="member-role"><span class="ru">Основательница</span><span class="en" hidden>Founder</span></div>
          <details>
            <summary><span class="ru">Подробнее</span><span class="en" hidden>More about her</span></summary>
            <div class="member-details-inner">
              <div><div class="m-field-label"><span class="ru">Хобби</span><span class="en" hidden>Hobbies</span></div>
                <div class="m-field-value"><span class="ru">Танцы, чтение.</span><span class="en" hidden>Dancing, reading.</span></div></div>
              <div><div class="m-field-label"><span class="ru">Мотивация</span><span class="en" hidden>Motivation</span></div>
